\section{Experiment 4: DC Analysis of CMOS Inverter}

\textbf{Aim:}  
To perform DC sweep analysis and obtain Voltage Transfer Curve (VTC) of CMOS inverter.

\textbf{Objective:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item To plot Vout vs Vin.
    \item To determine switching threshold (Vm).
    \item To analyze effect of NMOS/PMOS sizing.
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Theory:}  
The VTC shows noise margins and switching characteristics of inverter.  
Proper PMOS/NMOS sizing shifts the switching threshold.

\textbf{Procedure:}
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Implement CMOS inverter.
    \item Apply DC sweep to Vin from 0 to VDD.
    \item Observe Vout response.
    \item Change W/L values and repeat.
\end{enumerate}

