\section{Experiment 6: Implementation of 2:1 MUX Using NAND Gates}

\textbf{Aim:}  
To implement a 2:1 multiplexer using NAND gate logic and verify through simulation.

\textbf{Objective:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Realize MUX function using NAND-based NOT, AND, OR blocks.
    \item Verify output using simulation.
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Theory:}  
MUX function:
\[
Y = \bar{S}D_0 + SD_1
\]

\textbf{Procedure:}
\begin{enumerate}
