\section{Experiment 7: Implementation of 4:1 MUX Using NAND Gates}

\textbf{Aim:}  
To design and simulate 4:1 multiplexer using NAND-only logic.

\textbf{Objective:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Implement 4:1 MUX using NAND-based logic blocks.
    \item Verify output for all select line combinations.
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Theory:}  
4:1 MUX equation:
\[
Y = \bar{S_1}\bar{S_0}D_0 + \bar{S_1}S_0D_1 + S_1\bar{S_0}D_2 + S_1S_0D_3
\]

\textbf{Procedure:}
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Realize required AND/OR/NOT combinations using NAND logic.
    \item Connect all blocks to form full 4:1 multiplexer.
    \item Apply all select and data inputs.
